The property is **`functions`**. Its keys are glob patterns for function paths, and you put `maxDuration` (in seconds) inside each one:

```json
{
  "functions": {
    "api/*.js": { "maxDuration": 30 }
  }
}
```

Source: https://vercel.com/docs/project-configuration/vercel-json, found through Vercel

